2. Content
----------
The study pages and their working notes (public/talks/, sources/talks/,
public/index.html, public/privacy.html, public/404.html) are not covered by
the MIT License.

- The written notes, summaries and translations are (c) 2026 Haoli.
  All rights reserved.
- Slide screenshots, video frames and X post screenshots belong to their
  original authors and copyright holders, as credited on each page and in its
